  "details": "As the title says.\n\nRecently, VRChat has added a trampoline which has a user movement modifier ability. But it can be placed at the spawn point too; therefore, it may interfere with the user's experience by forcing the user to jump immediately after joining the world. \n\nPlease make sure it can not be placed at the spawn point.",
